# GitHub Packages Registry for @curious-bright scope (public packages)
@curious-bright:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com

# GitHub Packages Registry for @curious-bright-institutional scope (private institutional packages)
@curious-bright-institutional:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com

# Universal authentication for GitHub Packages (using Personal Access Token / GITHUB_TOKEN)
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
